      "Bisection Method for Root Finding: Based on Intermediate Value Theorem; requires continuous f(x) with f(a) \\cdot f(b) < 0; Iteration x_m = \\frac{a + b}{2}; Linearly convergent with guaranteed convergence rate \\epsilon_n = \\frac{b - a}{2^n}.",
