      "Newton-Raphson Method Formulation: Derived from first-order Taylor series truncation: x_{n+1} = x_n - \\frac{f(x_n)}{f'(x_n)}; Quadratic convergence (p=2) near simple roots; Fails when f'(x_n) \\approx 0 or near local extrema.",
