      "Simpson's 1/3 and 3/8 Rules: Simpson's 1/3 rule fits parabolas across pairs of intervals: I \\approx \\frac{h}{3}[f_0 + 4\\sum f_{odd} + 2\\sum f_{even} + f_n]; Requires even number of subintervals n; Truncation error E_S = -\\frac{(b-a)h^4}{180} f^{(4)}(\\xi).",
